+# Long-stay discount
+
+Request: reward customers who stay longer. A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price.
+Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+Rules: days = whole days of the period; under 3 days the price is unchanged; from 3 days the total is
+the full price less 10%, rounded to the nearest whole euro cent (half up). Implemented in `price()` in
+`src/index.ts`, shared by `quote` and `book`; covered by tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
